---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Freedom On Own Terms earns money and how that affects (and doesn't affect) our recommendations.">
  <section class="container page-head">
    <h1>Affiliate <span class="gradient-text">disclosure</span></h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: 3 November 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container prose">
    <p>
      Freedom On Own Terms is free to read. To keep it that way, some links on this site are <strong>affiliate links</strong>.
      If you click one and sign up for or buy a product, the company may pay us a commission. <strong>This costs you
      nothing extra</strong>, and the price you pay is the same.
    </p>
    <h2>How we choose tools</h2>
    <p>
      We list and recommend tools because we think they are genuinely useful, not because they pay us. Many tools in our
      directory have no affiliate program at all, and a commission never decides whether a tool is included or how it is
      described.
    </p>
    <h2>Sponsored content</h2>
    <p>
      If a company ever pays us to feature a tool, publish a review, or sponsor our newsletter, we will clearly label it as
      <strong>"Sponsored"</strong>.
    </p>
    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We may show advertising in the future. Ads are provided by third parties and do not mean we endorse the product
      advertised.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@freedomonownterms.com">hello@freedomonownterms.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
